<title>UK: Abbey National sets 200 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 200 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    17.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    17.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA    DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
